* hand-written from Razavi Fig. 5.43(a) -- topology only, no geometry
.title Razavi Fig. 5.43(a) — CE stage with base resistance
.global VCC
.subckt Fig5_43a vin vout
.iodir vin=input vout=output
.name vin v_in
.name vout v_out
RB vin a
.name RB R_B
RC VCC vout
.name RC R_C
Q1 vout a e npn
.name Q1 Q_1
RE e 0
.name RE R_E
.show a
.ends
